00:45:15.970 --> 00:45:17.590
You're gettin' on or what?


00:46:09.936 --> 00:46:12.676
It's not real.
No no, It's not real.


00:46:18.697 --> 00:46:20.997
It's not real. It's not real.


00:46:21.217 --> 00:46:26.518
It's not real. It's not real.


00:46:28.578 --> 00:46:31.079
It's not real. It's not real.


00:46:31.578 --> 00:46:35.079
It's not real. It's not real.


