00:55:10.721 --> 00:55:14.611
Cellular memory based on the theory that all
living tissues have the capacity to remember...


00:55:14.612 --> 00:55:19.391
cellular memory explains how energy
and information from...


00:55:19.392 --> 00:55:23.515
a donor's tissue can transfer, consciously
or unconsciously, to the recipient


