You can't ask me to do that.


00:56:50.093 --> 00:56:52.374
I could lose my license.


00:56:54.054 --> 00:57:00.955
Your license?...
Well, by all means, hold on to that license.


00:57:26.018 --> 00:57:27.918
Sydney, let's go.


00:57:29.618 --> 00:57:31.118
Sydney, come on.


00:57:38.819 --> 00:57:40.719
