01:01:34.928 --> 01:01:36.367
You're not making any sense.


01:01:36.368 --> 01:01:41.389
It's all happening to me, everything that
happened to her is happening to me.


01:01:41.929 --> 01:01:48.589
Until I find out who she is and what she wants,
it's gonna keep happening.


01:02:03.251 --> 01:02:04.871
To the center please.


