01:06:47.386 --> 01:06:49.966
Well, we can wait.
It's important.


01:06:50.106 --> 01:06:53.105
Emilio! It's okay.


01:06:53.106 --> 01:06:54.966
Come in.


01:06:55.947 --> 01:06:57.287
Come in.


01:07:05.908 --> 01:07:08.408
Please don't be long.
She is not well.


01:07:17.109 --> 01:07:22.089
Mrs. Martinez, my name is Sydney Wells and
this is my friend Dr. Paul Faulkner.


01:07:22.090 --> 01:07:24.110
What do you want?


01:07:26.470 --> 01:07:29.451
We would like to talk about your daughter.


01:07:30.671 --> 01:07:33.891
I was wondering about how she died.


01:07:34.511 --> 01:07:37.591
What business is this of yours?


01:07:37.592 --> 01:07:39.852
It's hard to explain.


01:07:40.272 --> 01:07:44.252
I have a connection... with your daughter.


01:07:57.855 --> 01:07:59.996
Oh, dear God...


01:08:07.955 --> 01:08:10.496
You have her eyes.


01:08:18.997 --> 01:08:23.297
I'm sorry for how I look. There was a fire
in the factory where I worked.


01:08:24.757 --> 01:08:30.698
