01:08:48.160 --> 01:08:50.380
Do you see things?


01:08:53.001 --> 01:08:56.781
- Things that are not real?
- Yeah.


01:08:57.721 --> 01:09:01.382
It's a terrible thing,
to see the spiritual world, isn't it?


01:09:01.442 --> 01:09:06.682
To see souls destined to repeat death
every day and unable to find peace?


01:09:06.842 --> 01:09:08.383
Yeah.


01:09:08.843 --> 01:09:13.983
Ana was always alone.
People around here were always afraid of her.


01:09:14.083 --> 01:09:17.344
