and she would just cry.


01:09:30.925 --> 01:09:33.826
And soon after, somebody
in that house would die.


01:09:34.366 --> 01:09:38.706
I know that she wasn't doing these things,
she wasn't bringing death to anyone, but...


01:09:39.086 --> 01:09:42.387
...she just could see death.


01:09:43.647 --> 01:09:46.587
This is a small town with many superstitious


01:09:48.047 --> 01:09:52.148
As I know as anything
better to do all that...


01:09:58.249 --> 01:10:00.949
- Call an ambulance.
- What?


01:10:01.009 --> 01:10:02.669
Call an ambulance.


01:10:06.570 --> 01:10:08.510
Every night...


01:10:08.850 --> 01:10:12.670
