Please save her.


01:10:12.770 --> 01:10:16.110
Save her.


01:10:16.171 --> 01:10:17.130
What happened?


01:10:17.131 --> 01:10:20.151
She's having a heart attack.
We gotta get her to the hospital.


01:10:20.331 --> 01:10:22.251
- Please, can you get her?
- Got her.


01:10:22.292 --> 01:10:23.291
Where're your keys?


01:10:23.292 --> 01:10:24.592
In my right hand pocket.


01:10:26.772 --> 01:10:29.512
Hey, open the door.
Alright bring her in, head in first.


01:10:30.613 --> 01:10:33.593
Go on the other side.
Put her in, head first.


01:10:34.093 --> 01:10:36.133
Can you hold her legs for me?


01:10:36.134 --> 01:10:38.353
- Got it.
- Have you almost there.


01:10:38.354 --> 01:10:41.293
All right, close the door, close the door.
Hurry up.


01:10:41.294 --> 01:10:43.453
Get the keys, you drive.
You know the way.


01:10:43.454 --> 01:10:44.714
Hurry up.


01:10:46.255 --> 01:10:48.334
Come on... come on.


01:10:48.335 --> 01:10:49.734
- I need to stay here.
- What?


01:10:49.735 --> 01:10:51.254
I'm fine.
Just go.


01:10:51.255 --> 01:10:53.195
I'll be quick.
Don't go anywhere.


01:12:06.624 --> 01:12:08.564
All right, Ana.


01:12:09.224 --> 01:12:11.064
I'm here.


01:12:11.065 --> 01:12:13.205
What do you want me to see?


01:12:40.565 --> 01:12:41.905
- My Mom!...
- Shut up Witch.


01:12:41.965 --> 01:12:43.205
- Where's my Mom?
- Get out’ a here!


01:12:43.206 --> 01:12:45.205
- Where's my Mom?
- Get out!


01:12:45.206 --> 01:12:46.905
- Please, where is my Mother?
- Get out, she's not here.


01:12:48.306 --> 01:12:52.905
- I wanna see my Mom.
- Do I have to throw you out?


01:12:52.906 --> 01:12:56.905
- No, no, no... Mommy!
- Come, help me get her out.


01:12:56.906 --> 01:13:00.905
- Get out.
- No, Mama! Mama!


01:13:06.906 --> 01:13:10.905
- What's going on?
- Nothing, go do your job!


01:13:11.506 --> 01:13:14.505
- Who was here?
- Nobody was here, go back to work!


01:13:14.506 --> 01:13:19.505
What's everybody staring at? Back to
work. Understand! Get back to work!


01:13:25.006 --> 01:13:27.505
Fire!


01:13:27.506 --> 01:13:29.905
Oh, my God, Help me!


01:13:42.206 --> 01:13:49.905
Mama? Mama?


01:13:52.206 --> 01:13:56.905
Witch! Witch! Witch!


01:14:07.879 --> 01:14:09.419
Hello?


01:14:13.479 --> 01:14:15.260
Paul, is that you?


01:14:56.163 --> 01:14:58.974
Forgive me.


01:15:01.485 --> 01:15:03.105
Ana?


01:15:05.865 --> 01:15:07.365
Ana?


01:15:08.366 --> 01:15:10.865
I have to do this, forgive me.


01:15:30.689 --> 01:15:33.029
Ana, no!
No!


01:15:33.249 --> 01:15:34.728
Help me?
Stop.


01:15:34.729 --> 01:15:36.669
Please.
God.


01:15:38.090 --> 01:15:43.390
No, no! No, no, no!


01:15:51.771 --> 01:15:55.472
Come on, come on.


01:15:56.572 --> 01:15:58.171
What am I supposed to do?


01:15:58.172 --> 01:16:00.112
Please, tell me?


01:16:00.852 --> 01:16:03.393
Your mother asked me to save you,
but I don't know how.


01:16:03.813 --> 01:16:05.692
What am I supposed to do?


01:16:05.693 --> 01:16:07.233
I don't know what to do here.


01:16:12.694 --> 01:16:13.954
What?


01:16:15.054 --> 01:16:17.674
What do you want from me?


01:16:18.935 --> 01:16:20.835
Tell me.


01:16:23.695 --> 01:16:25.505
Help, please.


01:16:25.520 --> 01:16:27.950
I did try to warn them.


01:16:28.976 --> 01:16:30.996
I believe you.


01:16:31.776 --> 01:16:36.117
I see what you saw. I know what
you've been through. I believe you.


01:16:38.304 --> 01:16:41.058
I tried to help and save them.


01:16:43.138 --> 01:16:45.238
It was never your fault.


01:17:26.143 --> 01:17:28.483
How is Mrs. Martinez?


01:17:28.943 --> 01:17:30.563
She didn't make it.


01:18:00.467 --> 01:18:02.647
Thank you.


01:18:33.431 --> 01:18:36.091
Hey, buddy.
What is going on?


01:18:36.791 --> 01:18:40.932
Some high speed chase on the American
side has the whole border shut down.


01:18:41.112 --> 01:18:42.631
Nearly an hour now.


01:18:42.632 --> 01:18:44.732
You might as well make yourself comfortable.


01:18:44.832 --> 01:18:46.412
Great.


01:18:46.632 --> 01:18:48.013
Thanks.


01:18:54.713 --> 01:18:58.734
- How long was I out?
- Not very long.


01:18:59.554 --> 01:19:01.614
It's freezing.


01:19:04.835 --> 01:19:06.455
What's going on?


01:19:06.795 --> 01:19:10.855
There's some kind of chase on the other side
of the border, that's why we're being held up.


01:19:11.315 --> 01:19:12.696
Really?


01:19:13.916 --> 01:19:15.856
You wanna play a game?


01:19:35.558 --> 01:19:37.379
Mommy?


01:19:48.040 --> 01:19:49.900
What're doing? Get back in the car.


01:19:51.040 --> 01:19:54.301
- Come on, you're scaring the little girl, let's go.
- Wait.


01:19:55.401 --> 01:19:58.141
What... you're scaring the hell
out of her, get back in the car!


01:20:00.881 --> 01:20:02.142
What?


01:20:06.282 --> 01:20:08.102
Oh, God!


01:20:11.283 --> 01:20:12.903
Sydney!


01:20:14.846 --> 01:20:17.492
Sydney! Sydney!


01:20:23.724 --> 01:20:26.104
Sorry about that.
You're alright? Sorry.


01:20:28.685 --> 01:20:31.545
I see the Shadows.
They're everywhere.


01:20:31.605 --> 01:20:35.945
Excuse! Excuse me, please.
Open up. Open up, please.


01:20:36.086 --> 01:20:38.685
Listen, there's gonna be an accident.
We don't have a lot of time.


01:20:38.686 --> 01:20:41.586
Please, just let me to talk to
the driver. Okay? Please!


01:20:44.807 --> 01:20:46.827
Miss, what're you doing?


01:20:56.328 --> 01:20:58.468
Oh my God.


01:21:07.569 --> 01:21:10.649
Don't you understand?
That's what she wanted me to see.


01:21:10.650 --> 01:21:12.769
Everything I dreamt wasn't from
Ana Christina's life. It was from this.


01:21:12.770 --> 01:21:14.790
Right now.


01:21:15.050 --> 01:21:17.850
She let me see that this was gonna
happen, so I wouldn't end up like her.


01:21:17.851 --> 01:21:19.991
She wants me to save these people.


01:21:21.611 --> 01:21:23.250
That's what she wants me to do.


01:21:23.251 --> 01:21:25.211
- Sydney.
- You have to believe me.


01:21:25.212 --> 01:21:27.032
You have to believe me.


01:21:41.774 --> 01:21:43.714
You need to get off this bus.


01:21:43.814 --> 01:21:45.714
Everyone needs to get off this bus.


01:21:47.174 --> 01:21:49.514
All of you...
You can't stay here.


01:21:51.695 --> 01:21:55.595
Everyone listen to me, you have to get off
this bus, you have to get off this bus, right now!


01:21:55.815 --> 01:21:57.355
- Is it like a terrorist thing?
- Yes.


01:21:58.016 --> 01:22:00.396
That's exactly what it's.
There's a bomb on the bus.


01:22:00.536 --> 01:22:02.676
- There is a bomb, a bomb.
- Quickly.


01:22:03.336 --> 01:22:04.916
Get out.


01:22:05.416 --> 01:22:07.757
Come on.
Get out of the car.


01:22:07.897 --> 01:22:09.416
Everyone.


01:22:09.417 --> 01:22:11.477
Come on. Come on.
Get away from here.


01:22:14.618 --> 01:22:16.057
There is a bomb in the bus.


01:22:16.058 --> 01:22:17.737
Come on. Come on.
Get out.


01:22:17.738 --> 01:22:19.478
- Go, go, go.
- Bomb, bomb, bomb.


01:22:19.538 --> 01:22:22.038
Come on. Come on.
Get out of your car.


01:22:22.899 --> 01:22:24.338
Wait here, sweetie.


01:22:24.339 --> 01:22:27.919
- What's going on?
- Get out of your car.


01:22:31.460 --> 01:22:33.720
Mom.


01:22:38.660 --> 01:22:41.281
Come on. Come on.
Get those people out of here.


01:22:41.621 --> 01:22:44.281
Get out of your car.


01:22:59.863 --> 01:23:01.243
Mommy!


01:23:03.003 --> 01:23:05.924
- You all right?
- Get my daughter, she is inside.


01:23:09.664 --> 01:23:13.064
- Open the door.
- How? Please.


01:23:13.065 --> 01:23:15.005
Please, help me..


01:23:16.625 --> 01:23:18.525
Help.


01:23:21.586 --> 01:23:23.213
Stay back.
I'm gonna break the window.


01:23:23.214 --> 01:23:25.286
Close your eyes.


01:23:32.427 --> 01:23:35.807
Come here, honey.


01:23:36.627 --> 01:23:38.808
Paul, let's go.


01:23:40.148 --> 01:23:41.387
Hurry up!


01:23:41.388 --> 01:23:44.288
- Come on, come on.
- Mom!


01:24:23.144 --> 01:24:25.495
You saved them, Sydney.


01:24:26.593 --> 01:24:31.734
You saved them, Sydney.
You saved them.


01:24:40.995 --> 01:24:43.315
Some say, seeing is believing.


01:24:43.316 --> 01:24:45.155
Now I know what they mean.


01:24:45.156 --> 01:24:47.736
Ana Christina tried to prevent death.


01:24:47.796 --> 01:24:50.976
But she was ultimately powerless
to stop it.


01:24:51.076 --> 01:24:54.817
Ana and I sure both have
a blessing and a curse.


01:25:08.599 --> 01:25:12.918
I know now, I don't need eyes to
see what truly matters.


01:25:12.919 --> 01:25:16.740
The gift of Ana's sight lead me
to see what I was afraid of...


01:25:16.760 --> 01:25:20.199
to use that vision,
to not only save myself and others...


01:25:20.200 --> 01:25:24.540
but to give Ana the peace she
never found in life.


01:25:25.555 --> 01:25:35.541
